  "definition": "Pretreatment",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-03-19",
  "historyNote": "#8235, eff 12-22-04 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1200) (formerly Env-Ws 1202.49); ss by #9798-A, eff 10-9-10 (Env-Wq 1202.48); ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
